WEBVTT

00:00:03.310 --> 00:00:05.690
Tell me, Sanada...

00:00:06.810 --> 00:00:10.610
Does Mitsunari still despise me?

00:00:22.120 --> 00:00:25.540
<b>It is almost two point
five decades since I was born</b>

00:00:25.540 --> 00:00:27.920
<b>I've had so many of jellos so far</b>

00:00:27.920 --> 00:00:30.710
<b>and how many more will I swallow from now on?</b>

00:00:30.710 --> 00:00:34.180
<b>I've already taken tons of exams</b>

00:00:34.180 --> 00:00:36.640
<b>and what else is coming up to me from now on?</b>

00:00:36.640 --> 00:00:39.810
<b>Daily lives must pass by quickly
without any "likes" and "hates"</b>

00:00:39.810 --> 00:00:41.470
<b>That girl who falls for guys easily,</b>

00:00:41.470 --> 00:00:43.940
<b>fell for another one then another
one and another one each time</b>

00:00:43.940 --> 00:00:45.350
<b>For a guy without such experience</b>

00:00:45.350 --> 00:00:49.610
<b>Everyday life now is like a stormy river</b>

00:00:49.610 --> 00:00:50.820
<b>So fast!</b>

00:00:53.780 --> 00:00:55.110
<b>Break out!</b>

00:00:57.450 --> 00:01:03.500
<b>(so) I sing to myself before I get sunk</b>

00:01:03.500 --> 00:01:08.380
<b>I jumped out to stop the streaming days</b>

00:01:08.380 --> 00:01:14.920
<b>The coastline I ran on that strong sunny day
(Shore line I ran)</b>

00:01:14.920 --> 00:01:19.600
<b>If you wanna take back that feeling
(take back that feeling)</b>

00:01:19.600 --> 00:01:23.850
<b>That feeling and give it a deep color of your own self
(take back that feeling)</b>

00:01:23.850 --> 00:01:26.770
<b>First, smash down that door</b>

00:01:37.620 --> 00:01:42.620
Verdict

00:01:43.250 --> 00:01:45.250
You are the one from that day...

00:01:45.250 --> 00:01:49.340
Yeah, I'm the man who lost to you at Odawara.

00:01:51.840 --> 00:01:55.180
And what brings that man to stand before me?

00:01:55.180 --> 00:01:57.600
Have you come to be defeated once more?

00:01:57.600 --> 00:02:00.770
Go ahead, say whatever you want.

00:02:00.770 --> 00:02:04.440
The reason I came here isn't
for revenge or anything like that.

00:02:04.440 --> 00:02:09.400
I just had a little something to
say to you... or actually, to myself.

00:02:09.400 --> 00:02:11.320
A declaration.

00:02:11.320 --> 00:02:13.990
You're just a transit point.

00:02:13.990 --> 00:02:15.570
In other words...

00:02:17.740 --> 00:02:19.620
Go to hell.

00:02:22.710 --> 00:02:24.420
OK?

00:02:25.250 --> 00:02:28.250
Your idle words do not concern me.

00:02:29.460 --> 00:02:30.800
However,

00:02:30.800 --> 00:02:34.470
if you mean to bar me from my path to Ieyasu,

00:02:34.470 --> 00:02:37.760
I will make it so you can
never open that yap of yours again.

00:02:37.760 --> 00:02:39.180
Fantastic.

00:02:39.180 --> 00:02:41.180
I'll have you know, this guy right here...

00:02:41.890 --> 00:02:43.640
...is strong!

00:02:46.730 --> 00:02:49.070
This is your punishment
for aligning yourself with Ieyasu!

00:02:49.070 --> 00:02:53.280
I will cut off your limbs and
turn you into an ugly snake!

00:02:54.110 --> 00:02:56.360
Then I won't hold anything back!

00:03:12.510 --> 00:03:14.300
Lord Masamune...

00:03:24.850 --> 00:03:27.350
You're good, just like I remember.

00:03:29.480 --> 00:03:32.690
Some interestin' things're
getting' started down there, too.

00:03:40.450 --> 00:03:43.040
Are you sure you should be here?

00:03:43.040 --> 00:03:46.620
O Katakura, who declares
himself the Right Eye of the Dragon?

00:03:47.830 --> 00:03:49.790
You worried about Ishida?

00:03:50.920 --> 00:03:52.920
You can drop the provocations, Otani.

00:03:52.920 --> 00:03:56.760
My only duty is to do the
job I've been entrusted with.

00:03:56.760 --> 00:03:58.220
And besides,

00:03:58.590 --> 00:04:01.300
as he is now, Lord Masamune is strong!

00:04:02.970 --> 00:04:04.890
You are quite confident.

00:04:04.890 --> 00:04:06.390
This battle

00:04:06.390 --> 00:04:10.860
is a line Lord Masamune resolved
to draw in order to move forward.

00:04:10.860 --> 00:04:13.190
The Dragon will race
across the heavens once more.

00:04:13.190 --> 00:04:16.240
And I won't let anyone get in the way of that!

00:04:17.150 --> 00:04:19.110
A dragon that races across the heavens?

00:04:19.110 --> 00:04:21.530
Funny you should say that.

00:04:23.330 --> 00:04:27.580
Before he goes racing across
the heavens, how about I...

00:04:27.580 --> 00:04:30.460
...take out his right eye here and now?!

00:04:34.130 --> 00:04:36.800
I despise this world!

00:04:36.800 --> 00:04:41.090
People lie, deceive, and ridicule.

00:04:42.140 --> 00:04:45.390
I have seen it time and time again.

00:04:45.390 --> 00:04:47.850
Behold those stars.

00:04:50.350 --> 00:04:53.900
Even in their brilliance, there is inequity.

00:04:55.150 --> 00:04:59.780
In that case, people and those glittering stars

00:04:59.780 --> 00:05:02.450
can all fall to the ground

00:05:02.450 --> 00:05:05.490
and have misery bestowed
upon them in equal measure.

00:05:05.490 --> 00:05:07.160
Wha...

00:05:07.160 --> 00:05:12.040
It will be Mitsunari and I who
bring about that world of equality!

00:05:12.040 --> 00:05:16.550
Now, you star scraps, come
raining down, tumbling out of the sky!

00:05:20.090 --> 00:05:23.930
Otani, so this was your intent
from the very beginning...

00:05:23.930 --> 00:05:25.390
Soon...

00:05:25.390 --> 00:05:27.270
Soon!

00:05:30.020 --> 00:05:33.810
Soon, there will be equal misery upon us all...

00:05:33.810 --> 00:05:36.820
It will come from the far reaches of the sky,

00:05:36.820 --> 00:05:40.570
marching along, wave after wave...

00:05:46.280 --> 00:05:48.790
Katakura...

00:05:48.790 --> 00:05:51.330
Can you not see it?

00:05:58.300 --> 00:06:00.300
Equal misery, you say?

00:06:00.300 --> 00:06:04.340
Yes, equal misery for all in this world!

00:06:05.930 --> 00:06:06.930
For me as well?

00:06:06.930 --> 00:06:08.760
For you as well.

00:06:08.760 --> 00:06:10.640
Yourself, too?

00:06:10.640 --> 00:06:12.310
Myself, too.

00:06:12.310 --> 00:06:13.980
And for Lord Masamune?

00:06:13.980 --> 00:06:15.980
And for the One-Eyed Dragon.

00:06:15.980 --> 00:06:17.230
And for Ishida?

00:06:17.230 --> 00:06:18.820
Mitsunari...

00:06:24.530 --> 00:06:30.750
I will allow no more misery to befall Mitsunari!

00:06:39.460 --> 00:06:42.090
Maybe you're capable of deceiving others,

00:06:42.090 --> 00:06:45.720
but it looks like you can't fool your own heart.

00:06:48.390 --> 00:06:53.060
Otani, right now, you're the kindest man alive.

00:07:04.150 --> 00:07:07.910
Mitsu... nari...

00:07:10.330 --> 00:07:12.580
Yer just what I expected, Master Tadakatsu!

00:07:12.580 --> 00:07:15.660
Yer bein' known as the warrin'
states' greatest warrior's no lie!

00:07:15.660 --> 00:07:17.580
What fun this is!

00:07:21.170 --> 00:07:22.760
<i>Tadakatsu...</i>

00:07:24.010 --> 00:07:27.510
<i>I killed Lord Hideyoshi with these hands.</i>

00:07:27.510 --> 00:07:30.930
<i>With these hands... using strength.</i>

00:07:34.430 --> 00:07:36.640
No gettin' distracted now!

00:07:36.640 --> 00:07:40.730
I'm an ol' fool, behind the times,
who only knows how to war.

00:07:40.730 --> 00:07:45.610
So I'm grateful to've met up with ya here.

00:07:45.610 --> 00:07:49.780
I'm gonna put all my might behind
this sword 'n I want ya to fight it!

00:07:49.780 --> 00:07:53.200
This Shimazu Jigen Style strike!

00:07:54.290 --> 00:07:57.370
Take this!

00:08:07.380 --> 00:08:11.760
'Twas a fine fight...

00:08:29.240 --> 00:08:33.280
Damn it! Doesn't that
pseudo-sun have any dead angles?!

00:08:33.280 --> 00:08:36.410
My Sun has no such things as dead angles.

00:08:36.410 --> 00:08:38.160
All movements thus far

00:08:38.160 --> 00:08:41.250
and the course of this battle
have gone just as I predicted.

00:08:41.250 --> 00:08:44.130
Here, upon Sekigahara,
it will be neither the East nor the West,

00:08:44.130 --> 00:08:47.300
but the land of Aki,
and Aki alone, to emerge victorious.

00:08:47.300 --> 00:08:52.720
Once this matter is concluded,
I will become its divine oracle.

00:08:52.720 --> 00:08:55.850
You killed my sons-of-bitches, used me,

00:08:55.850 --> 00:08:59.810
and spurred Ishida on to make a
mess of the land of the rising sun...

00:08:59.810 --> 00:09:02.650
And that was all just for yourself?!

00:09:02.650 --> 00:09:04.820
You won't get away with it...

00:09:04.820 --> 00:09:09.200
Mori, you're the one guy I'm going
to make sure doesn't get away with this!

00:09:10.070 --> 00:09:12.200
Howl all you like.

00:09:12.200 --> 00:09:17.620
With no sea and no ship,
what can you possibly do alone?

00:09:29.170 --> 00:09:30.550
Crap!

00:09:33.550 --> 00:09:36.140
Miserable, overly sentimental pirate...

00:09:36.140 --> 00:09:38.720
Meet your death, lost and wandering.

00:09:47.530 --> 00:09:48.650
Damn it!

00:09:48.650 --> 00:09:50.610
Boss, it's no good! There's nowhere to run!

00:09:50.610 --> 00:09:52.740
We're like rats in a trap!

00:09:52.740 --> 00:09:54.280
A trap?

00:09:55.620 --> 00:09:57.030
That's it!

00:09:57.030 --> 00:09:59.910
We just gotta pack that
pain-in-the-neck sun into a trap

00:09:59.910 --> 00:10:02.460
and give it right back to that bastard!

00:10:03.290 --> 00:10:05.460
Here we go, you sons-of-bitches!

00:10:05.460 --> 00:10:08.090
You got it, Boss!

00:10:17.680 --> 00:10:19.390
A futile struggle.

00:10:19.390 --> 00:10:21.390
Fire all rays at once!

00:10:31.190 --> 00:10:32.400
Wha...

00:10:40.080 --> 00:10:42.120
Ram them!

00:11:01.270 --> 00:11:03.600
My sun mirror...

00:11:10.400 --> 00:11:13.610
We did it, Boss!

00:11:12.940 --> 00:11:14.700
"Ogre of the Western Sea"

00:11:14.860 --> 00:11:18.990
I'm getting revenge... for my sons-of-bitches!

00:11:28.580 --> 00:11:30.000
Mori!

00:11:30.000 --> 00:11:32.460
Know that each of these blows

00:11:32.460 --> 00:11:36.680
holds the spirit of my sons-of-bitches who died!

00:11:36.680 --> 00:11:38.430
Their spirit?

00:11:38.430 --> 00:11:42.390
You have allowed hatred to blind you
and you would speak of spirit?

00:11:42.390 --> 00:11:45.140
The fault lies entirely with your foolish self.

00:11:45.140 --> 00:11:47.980
Yeah, I think so, too.

00:11:47.980 --> 00:11:50.690
But you see, I'll beat you,

00:11:50.690 --> 00:11:53.280
go to the gravesite of
my sons-of-bitches to report that,

00:11:53.280 --> 00:11:55.940
and look after all your men, too...

00:11:55.940 --> 00:11:57.400
And that'll be it.

00:11:57.400 --> 00:12:00.740
I'll forget all about you.

00:12:00.740 --> 00:12:01.870
What?

00:12:02.580 --> 00:12:04.540
This'll sound corny,

00:12:04.540 --> 00:12:07.750
but I got help from a lot of
different folks to get to where I am now,

00:12:07.750 --> 00:12:10.380
and that opened up my eyes.

00:12:10.380 --> 00:12:12.420
Worthless inanity.

00:12:15.550 --> 00:12:17.510
I'm fine with that.

00:12:17.510 --> 00:12:20.800
I'll never forget my sons-of-bitches who died.

00:12:20.800 --> 00:12:24.350
And even if I die, they'll remember me.

00:12:24.350 --> 00:12:29.730
But after you're dead,
no one'll be remembering you.

00:12:31.440 --> 00:12:33.770
What... did you say?

00:12:33.770 --> 00:12:37.780
Even if you were to seize the country
using whatever ploys you've got,

00:12:37.780 --> 00:12:40.410
I'm saying that no one'll talk about you.

00:12:41.530 --> 00:12:43.490
That's how you live your life.

00:12:43.490 --> 00:12:45.040
A solitary soul!

00:12:45.040 --> 00:12:49.000
And solitude's a thing that goes
on forever, even after you're dead!

00:12:49.000 --> 00:12:50.790
You bastard...

00:12:50.790 --> 00:12:53.500
You dare speak of me in this way?!

00:12:55.800 --> 00:12:58.130
I have not erred in any way whatsoever!

00:12:58.130 --> 00:13:02.010
Not strategically and not in
my path in life! Not in any way!

00:13:02.010 --> 00:13:04.140
Looks like when your temper
gets the better of you,

00:13:04.140 --> 00:13:06.970
you grow inattentive to your surroundings, too.

00:13:06.970 --> 00:13:08.640
Shut up!

00:13:18.820 --> 00:13:20.650
You ready?!

00:13:20.650 --> 00:13:22.660
Here goes, you sons-of-bitches!

00:13:22.660 --> 00:13:26.030
Yeah, Boss!

00:13:28.080 --> 00:13:29.620
Wha...?!

00:13:32.120 --> 00:13:36.630
Mori, go shed tears of regret
in the depths of your solitude.

00:13:52.350 --> 00:13:54.900
I got my business squared away here.

00:13:57.480 --> 00:14:00.530
Ieyasu... Ishida...

00:14:08.870 --> 00:14:10.450
Lord Masamune.

00:14:17.040 --> 00:14:19.550
My objective is Ieyasu's head!

00:14:19.550 --> 00:14:22.720
You are nothing more than
wild grass by the side of the road!

00:14:22.720 --> 00:14:24.340
Wild grass, huh?

00:14:24.340 --> 00:14:28.180
Ever heard of how strong weeds are, Ishida?

00:14:29.560 --> 00:14:32.020
So you lost one little skirmish against me.

00:14:32.020 --> 00:14:33.640
What of it?!

00:14:33.640 --> 00:14:37.690
That day, I tasted eternal defeat!

00:14:39.530 --> 00:14:41.490
Toyotomi's death, huh?

00:14:41.490 --> 00:14:43.860
And what did you do in the context of that loss?

00:14:43.860 --> 00:14:46.200
Did you blame someone? Hate someone?

00:14:46.200 --> 00:14:47.620
Silence!

00:14:47.620 --> 00:14:49.910
What could you possibly know about me?!

00:14:49.910 --> 00:14:51.830
You're right, I don't know squat.

00:14:51.830 --> 00:14:54.080
But the thing is, I came to a realization.

00:14:54.580 --> 00:14:56.040
And that realization

00:14:56.040 --> 00:14:58.670
might be the thing that makes
Sanada and me better than you.

00:14:58.670 --> 00:14:59.670
What?!

00:14:59.670 --> 00:15:01.130
That's why...

00:15:01.590 --> 00:15:03.590
...you can't win against me!

00:15:03.590 --> 00:15:05.720
I care nothing about you people!

00:15:05.720 --> 00:15:07.640
Be gone!

00:15:22.730 --> 00:15:26.070
Why? Why will this blade not reach?!

00:15:26.070 --> 00:15:28.620
I'm grateful to you.

00:15:28.620 --> 00:15:31.030
You showed me how far I still had to go...

00:15:31.030 --> 00:15:35.750
You reminded me that I've got the
Right Eye of the Dragon by my side.

00:15:37.170 --> 00:15:41.300
Your drivel does not interest me!

00:15:49.800 --> 00:15:51.180
What?!

00:16:14.870 --> 00:16:16.830
Why do you not kill me?

00:16:16.830 --> 00:16:18.710
Is this your idea of mercy?!

00:16:19.920 --> 00:16:22.880
I'm not interested in taking your life.

00:16:22.880 --> 00:16:25.920
I came to settle a score for myself, that's all.

00:16:30.680 --> 00:16:32.800
End of judgement.

00:16:32.800 --> 00:16:36.020
The verdict is in for you and me.

00:16:36.020 --> 00:16:37.730
But Ishida,

00:16:37.730 --> 00:16:41.610
for the big fight that you dragged
the land of the rising sun into,

00:16:41.610 --> 00:16:44.610
make sure you square things away good yourself.

00:16:58.750 --> 00:17:00.920
So you forgave him?

00:17:00.920 --> 00:17:02.420
Forgave?

00:17:05.130 --> 00:17:08.590
I'm not that admirable.

00:17:08.590 --> 00:17:11.260
I've seen that look in his eyes...

00:17:11.260 --> 00:17:12.680
That look...

00:17:15.810 --> 00:17:18.810
Surely, it resembles that of yourself.

00:17:18.810 --> 00:17:22.690
Hell isn't just a place you
can end up after you're dead.

00:17:22.690 --> 00:17:27.440
Whether you can crawl up out of
there has to do with luck or maybe...

00:17:29.900 --> 00:17:31.860
Lord Masamune?

00:17:31.860 --> 00:17:34.320
I'm a lucky guy.

00:17:41.250 --> 00:17:43.330
Tell me, Sanada...

00:17:44.500 --> 00:17:48.630
Does Mitsunari still despise me?

00:17:50.220 --> 00:17:53.510
Master Ishida is a man with a pure heart.

00:17:53.510 --> 00:17:58.140
Yes, and he is hurt easily
because of his pure heart.

00:17:58.140 --> 00:18:01.230
We cannot understand one
another if we do not face each other.

00:18:01.230 --> 00:18:03.730
That was what you said, was it not, Sanada?

00:18:39.680 --> 00:18:42.680
<i>What lies stretched
across this world is strength.</i>

00:18:42.680 --> 00:18:47.150
<i>Yes, Lord Hideyoshi, you were right.</i>

00:18:48.400 --> 00:18:52.820
People want to be enveloped in
great strength to gain a sense of security.

00:18:52.820 --> 00:18:54.950
I, too, sought strength

00:18:54.950 --> 00:18:57.490
and many of those who placed
their faith in me in the past,

00:18:57.490 --> 00:19:00.120
I sent to their deaths.

00:19:01.370 --> 00:19:02.660
But...

00:19:02.660 --> 00:19:04.750
...that cannot be!

00:19:04.750 --> 00:19:07.080
If we accept such a world as normal,

00:19:07.080 --> 00:19:09.630
people will die all too easily!

00:19:09.630 --> 00:19:13.550
That is why I have decided to
take all the strength in this world

00:19:13.550 --> 00:19:16.970
and conceal it in the cloak of our shared bonds.

00:19:19.510 --> 00:19:21.350
From this day forth,

00:19:21.350 --> 00:19:24.770
I will be guilty of the heinous
crime of duping the country!

00:19:37.820 --> 00:19:42.040
For Mitsunari, I...

00:20:39.010 --> 00:20:44.100
Mitsunari... go on...

00:20:44.100 --> 00:20:47.480
To see that man...

00:21:18.420 --> 00:21:25.640
<b>miageyou ima ano Polaris wo</b>

00:21:18.420 --> 00:21:25.640
<b>Look up to that Polaris now</b>

00:21:30.690 --> 00:21:35.610
<b>kono shinzou wa kokoro wo motazu</b>

00:21:30.690 --> 00:21:35.610
<b>My heart doesn' </b>t contain a spirit

00:21:35.610 --> 00:21:40.070
<b>nemurenai toki wo kizamu dake da yo</b>

00:21:35.610 --> 00:21:40.070
<b>It merely marks the passage of sleepless hours</b>

00:21:40.070 --> 00:21:43.870
<b>ryoute de tsuchi wo kakiatsumeta</b>

00:21:40.070 --> 00:21:43.870
<b>Scraping up bare earth with my two hands</b>

00:21:43.870 --> 00:21:49.120
<b>ano hito no kotoba made ume ya shinai zenshin koso</b>

00:21:43.870 --> 00:21:49.120
<b>won' </b>t fill the hole left by that person' s words

00:21:49.120 --> 00:21:53.920
<b>jouzu ni karada wo mushibande iku</b>

00:21:49.120 --> 00:21:53.920
<b>which are eating up my body</b>

00:21:57.710 --> 00:22:02.180
<b>hora goran yo ano Polaris wo</b>

00:21:57.710 --> 00:22:02.180
<b>Just look at that Polaris</b>

00:22:02.180 --> 00:22:06.430
<b>uranometoria wo hirogetara</b>

00:22:02.180 --> 00:22:06.430
<b>When you open the pages of the Uranometria</b>

00:22:06.430 --> 00:22:14.560
<b>yogoreta tenohira ga kiten da to oshiete kureru</b>

00:22:06.430 --> 00:22:14.560
<b>It' </b>ll tell you your dirty hands are the reference point

00:22:15.060 --> 00:22:19.730
<b>sagasu sagase yo kono samuzora ni</b>

00:22:15.060 --> 00:22:19.730
<b>Searching, searching the cold night sky</b>

00:22:19.730 --> 00:22:24.200
<b>anata no murui na kagayaki de</b>

00:22:19.730 --> 00:22:24.200
<b>for your exceptional brightness</b>

